WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.132
Plan to quote, with a person in the loop.

2
00:00:01.132 --> 00:00:04.956
A plan-to-quote desk for a small New Zealand builder.

3
00:00:04.956 --> 00:00:07.897
A person confirms the scale first. Nothing is measured until they do.

4
00:00:07.897 --> 00:00:12.015
Then the agent finds the rooms and measures them.

5
00:00:12.015 --> 00:00:15.544
It asks the consent question and lists the Building Code clauses to check.

6
00:00:15.544 --> 00:00:19.074
It flags defects to look for on site. A person picks the provisional sums.

7
00:00:19.074 --> 00:00:23.779
Materials with waste, labour hours, P&G, margin, then GST at 15%.

8
00:00:23.779 --> 00:00:27.309
Nothing goes to the client until a named person approves it.

9
00:00:27.309 --> 00:00:30.868
Every step leaves a receipt.

10
00:00:30.838 --> 00:00:36.044
